<view class="home-page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="brand-mark">橡</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">
      <text class="eyebrow">RUBBER FACTORY ERP</text>
      <text class="title">工厂数据，随时查阅</text>
      <text class="subtitle">模具、货架、订单、生产与品检共用网站实时数据</text>
    </view>
    <view class="network {{online ? 'online' : 'offline'}}">
      <view class="network-dot"></view>
      <text>{{networkText}}</text>
    </view>
    <button class="primary-entry" data-path="/" bindtap="openModule">打开 ERP 工作台</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-heading">
    <text class="section-title">快捷入口</text>
    <text class="section-tip">选择要查看的板块</text>
  </view>

  <view class="module-grid">
    <button
      wx:for="{{modules}}"
      wx:key="path"
      class="module-card"
      data-path="{{item.path}}"
      bindtap="openModule"
      hover-class="module-card-active"
    >
      <view class="module-icon">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="module-copy">
        <text class="module-title">{{item.shortTitle}}</text>
        <text class="module-description">{{item.description}}</text>
      </view>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    <text class="notice-title">使用说明</text>
    <text>首次打开需要使用工厂 ERP 共用账号登录，登录后查看的是服务器中的实时数据。</text>
  </view>
</view>
